                It’s also recommended to carry local currency (Kenyan Shilling) or use credit cards, and remember to dress modestly when visiting rural areas or cultural sites. During safaris, respect wildlife and follow the safety guidelines provided by your guide. At Lenmanya Adventures, we’re committed to offering personalized services that ensure your trip to Kenya is not only hassle-free but filled with unforgettable experiences
